{1}{Ahoy! Take as long as ye need matey. Me ship be needin' some repairs, so we're gonna stay put for a while.}{Ahoy! Take as long as ye need matey. Me ship be needin' some repairs, so we're gonna stay put for a while.}{}{}{}{}
